#| "your printing system. However, some printers are independently capable of "
#| "printing multiple pages per sheet. In which case you find the option in "
#| "the printer driver settings. Be careful: if you enable multiple pages per "
#| "sheet in both places, your printout will not look as you intended. </p> "
#| "<br>  <hr>  <p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint "
